{"task_id": "Mbpp/88", "solution": "def freq_count(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the frequency of all elements in a list.\n    Returns a dictionary mapping each element to its count.\n    \"\"\"\n    frequencies = {}\n    for item in input_list:\n        frequencies[item] = frequencies.get(item, 0) + 1\n    return frequencies"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/85", "solution": "def surfacearea_sphere(radius) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the surface area of a sphere given its radius.\n    It uses the formula: 4 * PI * r^2.\n    \"\"\"\n    PI_CONSTANT = 3.141592653589793\n    surface_area = 4 * PI_CONSTANT * (radius ** 2)\n    return surface_area"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the nth term of the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    It stores previously computed values to avoid redundant calculations.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    # For n > 2: sequence(n) = sequence(sequence(n-1)) + sequence(n - sequence(n-1))\n    s_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    result = sequence(s_n_minus_1) + sequence(n - s_n_minus_1)\n    \n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
