{"task_id": "Mbpp/250", "solution": "def count_X(tuple_arg, element) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Count how many times `element` occurs in `tuple_arg`.\n\n    Parameters:\n    - tuple_arg: tuple (required) -- the tuple to search\n    - element: any -- the element to compare to items using ==\n\n    Returns:\n    - int: number of matching occurrences\n\n    Raises:\n    - TypeError: if tuple_arg is not a tuple\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(tuple_arg, tuple):\n        raise TypeError(\"tuple_arg must be a tuple\")\n\n    count = 0\n    for item in tuple_arg:\n        if item == element:\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
