{"task_id": "Mbpp/619", "solution": "def move_num(input: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Moves all numeric characters to the end of the string while preserving relative order.\n    Non-digit characters appear first, followed by digit characters, both in their original relative order.\"\"\"\n    non_digits = []\n    digits = []\n    for char in input:\n        if char.isdigit():\n            digits.append(char)\n        else:\n            non_digits.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(non_digits) + \"\".join(digits)"}
